OH 7.0 renamed two parts the fajita product lists: the HDF device host (hdf_devhost) moved from drivers_adapter
(drivers/peripheral/adapter) to drivers_devhost (drivers/peripheral/devhost), and the QR code library qrcodegen
was replaced by qrcode_generator, which productdefine/common/inherit/rich.json already lists.

diff --git a/fajita/config.json b/fajita/config.json
--- a/fajita/config.json
+++ b/fajita/config.json
@@ -65,7 +65,7 @@
           "features": []
         },
         {
-          "component": "drivers_adapter",
+          "component": "drivers_devhost",
           "features": []
         }
       ]
@@ -258,10 +258,6 @@
           "features": []
         },
         {
-          "component": "qrcodegen",
-          "features": []
-        },
-        {
           "component": "alsa-lib",
           "features": []
         },
